sayon overseas&nbsp;was established in&nbsp;2013 mr. dheepakh &amp; mrs. swapna are the partners of this&nbsp;firm. our&nbsp;company concentrates on the present &amp; future market of our indian pet food industry. in the past we were using some well-known brands and we were shocked to see that they were using the ingredients that are unfit for human consumption and so our quest began! many people like us wanted to feed their pets only the good quality pet foods which lead them in good health and better longevity. hence we found a gaping hole in the indian pet food market so we finally decided to close that gap by introducing a very good quality pet food in india. the industry is in the developing stage and we want to be an important part of the industry. there are very few good quality pet foods which comes and goes without making a proper stand in india. our goal is to fulfill the requirement of our people by giving them a good quality product consistently by which there will be a tremendous growth in the pet food industry.
&nbsp;
since we don't compromise on quality we are able to attract large amount of clients in india. through our client feedback and queries we are able to measure their satisfaction regarding quality and take necessary steps to meet their needs. quality is the front face of our firm and we assure that it is delivered to our respective clients. our approach has always been to educate our clients and support them using a natural holistic approach.

initially we were dealing with a third party&rsquo;s brand for a while and in the month of june 2015 we have launched our own pet food brand in india called &ldquo;goodness&rdquo;. we have an awesome range of dog food recipes with exotic meat ranges like duck salmon trout pork and turkey like no other dog food in our indian market. our recipes are manufactured in the uk under proper regulations and created with the help of leading nutritionists who are experienced in formulating grain free high meat diets. mr. dheepakh. (partner)&nbsp;maintains proper communication with his respective partner as well as supporting staff. our partner with his vast knowledge in the pet food industry is able to distinguish from good and bad pet foods. he poses impeccable talent of foresees his client's needs.&nbsp;mrs. swapna &nbsp;owns a nutritional degree background who discovered throughout their research that most available dog foods contained a high proportion of plant proteins and/or did not specify the protein source and overall had very little in the way of meat. we are a company who strongly believes that only the best ingredients will make the best pet food.
our warehousing facilities has enormous amount of storage area for storing pet foods safely. further we are engaged in dividing firm in various units which help us in maintaining diversified working situations and this helps in concentrating in exports of other products as well. our delivery is speedy due to our partnership with well-established logistic networks.
